  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under NIST SP 800-34 Rev. 1, a Business Impact Analysis (BIA) is the foundational first step in BCP development. The BIA identifies critical business processes, quantifies financial and operational impact of disruption, and establishes recovery priorities.
Wrong (B): Purchasing hardware before completing analysis risks spending without knowing which systems are most critical or what recovery targets are needed.
