  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Per ITIL 4 configuration management and COBIT 2019 BAI10 (Managed Configuration), servers absent from the CMDB are invisible to IT management processes. They may be missed during security patching, excluded from change impact assessments, and overlooked in disaster recovery planning.
